{
  "version": 2,
  "_comment": "Built-in look presets are sparse overlays authored against the nested SpektraParams schema and mapped by BuiltInPresets.applyParams; omitted fields retain their current editor values. Only ENGINE-HONORED fields are set: grain is fully tunable (and per-stock here, since the engine otherwise gives every stock Portra-400 grain); halation uses halationAmount/scatterAmount/boost (halationStrength + halationFirstSigmaUm are baked from each profile's use/antihalation tags and ignored); DIR couplers use amount/inhibition/diffusion (gamma matrices are baked per stock); diffusionFilter geometry and filterFamily are honored. Grain/halation are um-based and so look stronger at full-res/zoom than in the fit preview.",
